    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "SAN FRANCISCO /\nOAKLAND\nEFFECTIVE JUNE 1, 1964\nUNITED\nUNITED JETS\nTO HAWAII...\nECONOMY COACH JETS\nONLY $100\nCUSTOM COACH JETS\nONLY $110*\n(see map page)",
      "VANCOUVER, B.C\nHONOLULU\nPORTLAND\nSALEM\nEUGENE\nMEDFORD\nELKO\nSAN FRANCISCO\nOAKLAND\nMONTEREY:\nSALINAS\nSACRAMENTO\nSTOCKTON\nMOSESTO\nMERCED\nFRESNO\nVISALIA\nBAKERSFIELD\nSANTA BARBARA\nLOS ANGELES\nSAN DIEGO\nPOKANE\nBOISE\nELY\nLAS VEGAS\nSALT LAKE CITY\nGRAND JUNCTION\nDENVER\nUNITED FLIES BY ELGIN WATCH TIME\nTRANSCONTINENTAL NONSTOP JET SERVICE\nSEATTLE TACOMA\nNEW YORK\nPHILADELPHIA\nSAN FRANCISCO\nWASHINGTON\nLOS ANGELES\nMINNEAPOLIS-ST. PAUL\nSAGINAW-BAY CHA\nMIDLAND\nMUSKEOG\nFLINT\nROCHESTER\nHARTEORO SPRINGFIELD\nMIRA-CORNING\nBOSTON\nPROVIDENCE\nGRAND R\nDETROIT\nCEDAR RA\nCAGO\nFORT WAYNE\nPITTSBURGH\nNEW YORK-\nYOUNGSTOWN WARREN\nNEWARK\nALLENTO\nANN-BETHLEHEM EASTON\nRISBURG\nPHILADELPHIA\nOMAHA\nMOLINE-ROCK ISLAND-DAVENPORT DAYTON\nLINCOLN\nCOLUMBUS\nCHARLESTON, W. VA.\nRICHMOND\nBALTIMORE\nWASHINGTON\nNEWPORT NEWS HAMPTON\nWILLIAMSBURG\nNORFOLK-PORTSMOUTH\nBRISTOL KINGSPORT -JOHNSON CITY\nKANSAS CITY\nGREENSBORO-HIGH POINT.\nWINSTON SALEM\nKNOXVILLE\nASHEVILLE\nCHARLOT\nCHATTANOOGA\nRALEIGH-DURHAM\nMEMPHIS -\nHUNTSVILL\nATLANTA\nJACKSON VILLE\nMOBILE\nNEW ORLEANS\nTAMPA-\nST. PETERSBURG:\nCLEARWATER\nWEST PALM BEACH\nFORT LAUDERDALE\nUNITED INCREASES JET SCHEDULES\nTO HAWAII. • • 23 JETS A WEEK†\nUnited offers you a wide choice of service and\nschedules to Hawaii... a total of 23 flights\nweekly to Hawaii. Here are some of the features\nof Custom Coach service: Your choice of cock-\ntails or champagne for your aloha toast!. A\ndelicious full-course meal specially prepared in\nour world-famous flight kitchens!. A Hawaiian\nsteward and colorfully attired stewardesses to\nprovide excellent in-flight service! All this for $23\nless than ever before.\n*Effective June 1 Subject to Government Approval\n*Schedules Effective June 5\nUNITED\nTHE EXTRA CARE AIRLINE"
    ],
